  "_comment": "County-wide comparison. Current rates are the 2025 Final Adopted rate for each municipal taxing entity in Utah County (the rate levied on today's bills), read from the Utah State Tax Commission's Report 600. Proposed increases are the 2026 Truth-in-Taxation cycle. The two come from different sources and different years \u2014 see `caveats`.",
